(11, 'Yoo man', 'EMail services', '<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hope you&#39;re having a great day!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Just following up to see if you&rsquo;ve had a chance to review our earlier emails from EngineerIP. We&rsquo;d love to offer you a trial engagement at a significant cost on our IP support services&mdash;especially if you currently need assistance with:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Freedom to Operate (FTO) Searches (U.S. &amp; EU)</strong> - $775 &ndash; $1000<br />\r\n<strong>Patent Drawings &amp; Illustrations </strong>- $21 &ndash; $25 per drawing<br />\r\n<strong>Worldwide Prior Art &amp; Patentability Searches</strong> -&nbsp; $275 &ndash; $500</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide detailed, customized reports using 140+ databases, including access to STN for chemical searches and coverage across 80+ countries (JP, CN, KR, DE, etc.).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please feel free to share your requirements at <a href=\"mailto:mike@engineer-ip.com\">mike@engineer-ip.com</a>, and we&rsquo;ll get back with a detailed cost and timeline estimate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking forward to hearing from you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Warm regards,<br />\r\nMike</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<table align=\"center\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; width:200px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">&nbsp;</span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Engineer</span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><em>IP</em></span></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Mike Adler</span></span></strong><br />\r\n			&nbsp; <em>(Manager &ndash; Sales )</em></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>&nbsp;Contact:&nbsp;<a href=\"tel:+1-302-302-1650\">+1-302-302-1650</a><br />\r\n			&nbsp;1207 Delaware Ave #759, Wilmington DE 19806</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:mike@engineer-ip.com\">mike@engineer-ip.com</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.engineerip.com\">www.engineerip.com</a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"2\"><em><small>This email is intended only for the individual to whom it is addressed and may contain information that is privileged, confidential, or exempt from disclosure under applicable law. If you believe you have received this email in error, please notify the sender immediately by return email, and delete the original message without retaining any copy thereof in any form</small></em></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:right\"><em><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Click here to <a href=\"mailto:mike@engineer-ip.com?subject=Unsubscribe\">Unsubscribe</a></span></em></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Michael Adler &lt;<a href=\"mailto:mike@engineer-ip.com\" target=\"_blank\">mike@engineer-ip.com</a>&gt;<br />\r\n<strong>Sub:</strong>&nbsp;Mike - Drafting and Drawings services Info.<br />\r\n<strong>To:</strong>&nbsp;{{first_name}}</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trust you are having a great day!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hope you have been getting emails from our company EngineerIP. We would like to take this opportunity to offer you the Patent services at highly discounted cost for a trial one. Let us know if you have a need at this time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly share your requirements at <a href=\"mailto:mike@engineer-ip.com\">mike@engineer-ip.com</a> to get a cost and timeline estimate.</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#ccc\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:80%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:antiquewhite; text-align:center; vertical-